      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To make that feeling inevitable, focus on showing the relentless pressure that leads to that final decision, rather than just stating the decision itself. Detail the tiny, constant erosions—the moments where the effort required to maintain the facade becomes too exhausting to bear. Show the *logic* of the surrender; make it feel less like a sudden crash and more like a slow, inevitable tide pulling everything toward its natural level. This way, the darkness feels less like an external force and more like a necessary, final destination.",
